== Pilot variance for the seed-count decision (protocol section 5)
<pilot-variance-for-the-seed-count-decision-protocol-section-5>
Paired SIM minus RAND drift over 10 exploratory seeds (pilot block, full
EXP-002 size, adaptive, eta = 0.05). The mean difference is shown only
because the SD is computed around it; it is not interpreted.

- SD of paired differences: 0.01587 rad
- Mean paired difference (not interpreted): -0.15881 rad
- Projected 95 % paired t half-width: n = 5: 0.01970 rad, n = 10:
  0.01135 rad, n = 20: 0.00743 rad, n = 30: 0.00593 rad
- Protocol threshold: SESOI / 2 = 0.025 rad. Ten seeds are adequate by
  this rule.

